Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:04.42,hmz,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\fs18\pos(265,120)}人類
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:04.42,hmz,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\fs15\pos(306,317)}仇恨值減少
